{"question_text": {"স্পেশাল বিসিএস [স্বাস্থ্য] - মেডিকেল অংশ ": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) Which vitamin is synthesised by lower gut bacteria?", "option1": "Vitamin B1", "option2": "Vitamin B2", "option3": "Vitamin D", "option4": "Vitamin K", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3380.jpeg\" width=\"1093\" height=\"829\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) Endotoxin is a component of", "option1": "Gram positive bacteria cell wall", "option2": "Gram positive bacteria cell membrane ", "option3": "Gram negative bacteria cell membrane \r\n", "option4": "Gram negative bacteria cell wall", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p><strong>সঠিক উত্তর- Gram negative bacteria cell outer membrane.</strong><br>ভুলবশত অপশন গ) তে 'outer' শব্দটি লিখা হয়নি।<br>অপশন বিবেচনায় উত্তর হিসেবে অপশন গ) নেওয়া হয়েছে।<br>---------<br><br><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3379.jpeg\" width=\"1472\" height=\"832\" alt=\"\"></p>\r\n<p><acp-dt></acp-dt></p>"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) Most common bacteria found in normal flora of vagina?", "option1": "Lactobacillus ", "option2": "Propionibacterium", "option3": "Staphylococcus saprophyticus", "option4": "Haemophilus", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3378.jpeg\" width=\"1857\" height=\"1376\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) Which antibody is found in maximum amount in external secretion?", "option1": "IgG", "option2": "IgA", "option3": "IgM", "option4": "IgD", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>Presence of antibody in body secretion IgA&gt;IgG&gt;IgM</p>"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) Which virus commonly causes acute gastroenteritis in adult? ", "option1": "Rota virus", "option2": "Noro virus", "option3": "Vibrio cholerae", "option4": "Entamoeba histolytica ", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3376.jpeg\" width=\"1253\" height=\"1100\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) Which is the vector of leishmaniasis?", "option1": "Mosquito ", "option2": "Sandfly", "option3": "Louse", "option4": "Tick", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3401.jpeg\" width=\"1870\" height=\"1103\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) Pathognomonic feature of measles-", "option1": "Fever with rash", "option2": "Conjunctivitis ", "option3": "Koplik spots", "option4": "Coryza ", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3402.jpeg\" width=\"1611\" height=\"883\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) Which one of the following is the treatment for stress incontinence?", "option1": "Bladder retraining ", "option2": "Pelvic floor muscle training", "option3": "Surgical relief of obstruction ", "option4": "Intermittent catheterisation ", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3151_EjdgSUi.jpeg\" width=\"829\" height=\"1296\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) Secondary causes of weight gain include all except", "option1": "Hypothyroidism", "option2": "Cushing syndrome", "option3": "Addison’s disease", "option4": "Insulinoma", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>Addison’s disease causes hypotension, weight loss and hyperpigmentation.</p>"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) Which of the following is an example of essential amino acid?", "option1": "Cysteine", "option2": "Tyrosine", "option3": "Tryptophan", "option4": "Glycine", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3159_jgM5Deo.jpeg\" width=\"1360\" height=\"979\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "11", "question": "১১) Which of the following organism causes bloody diarrhoea?", "option1": "Rota virus", "option2": "EHEC", "option3": "Salmonella", "option4": "Giardia", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3376_Yq0NIhy.jpeg\" width=\"1253\" height=\"1100\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "12", "question": "১২) Common hematological features of dengue includes all except", "option1": "Leucopenia", "option2": "Lymphopenia", "option3": "Thrombocytopenia ", "option4": "Neutropenia ", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3410.jpeg\" width=\"1044\" height=\"809\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "13", "question": "১৩) Vitamin D deficiency causes-", "option1": "Osteoarthritis ", "option2": "Osteoporosis ", "option3": "Osteomalacia ", "option4": "Osteopenia", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>Vitamin D deficiency causes rickets in children and osteomalacia in adult.</p>"}, {"id": "14", "question": "১৪) Which oral antibiotic is commonly used in the treatment of leptospirosis?", "option1": "Azythromycin", "option2": "Ciprofloxacin", "option3": "Doxycycline ", "option4": "Penicillin ", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3411.jpeg\" width=\"1319\" height=\"845\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "15", "question": "১৫) Where the bacilli of enteric fever live in the body of chronic carriers? ", "option1": "Lymphoid tissue", "option2": "Spleen", "option3": "Small intestine ", "option4": "Gall bladder ", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3406.jpeg\" width=\"1316\" height=\"812\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "16", "question": "১৬) Complications of typhoid fever includes-", "option1": "Gut obstruction ", "option2": "Pancreatitis ", "option3": "Pericarditis ", "option4": "Cholecystitis", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3407.jpeg\" width=\"828\" height=\"514\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "17", "question": "১৭) Which is the most common cause of traveller’s diarrhoea?", "option1": "ETEC", "option2": "EIEC", "option3": "EHIC", "option4": "EPEC", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3412.jpeg\" width=\"950\" height=\"546\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "18", "question": "১৮) Which stage of malaria parasite causes fever in the human body?", "option1": "Gametocyte", "option2": "Sporozoites", "option3": "Merozoites", "option4": "Adult parasite", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3390.jpeg\" width=\"1449\" height=\"856\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "19", "question": "১৯) Drug of choice for enteric fever-", "option1": "Azithromycin", "option2": "Penicillin ", "option3": "Cephalosporin", "option4": "Fluoroquinolones", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3413.jpeg\" width=\"824\" height=\"946\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "20", "question": "২০) Treatment of choice for complicated malaria?", "option1": "Mefloquine ", "option2": "Chloroquine ", "option3": "Intravenous artesunate ", "option4": "Intravenous artemether", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3389.jpeg\" width=\"1421\" height=\"908\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "21", "question": "২১) Most common cause of genital ulceration", "option1": "Genital herpes", "option2": "Syphilis", "option3": "Candida", "option4": "Trichomonus", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3388.jpeg\" width=\"1204\" height=\"1072\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "22", "question": "২২) Snail tract mouth ulcer is found in", "option1": "Primary syphilis ", "option2": "Secondary syphilis", "option3": "Latent syphilis", "option4": "Tertiary syphilis", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3387.jpeg\" width=\"1161\" height=\"772\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "23", "question": "২৩) Investigation of choice for enteric fever-", "option1": "Widal test", "option2": "Blood culture", "option3": "Stool culture ", "option4": "USG of whole abdomen", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3408.jpeg\" width=\"1120\" height=\"378\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "24", "question": "২৪) Non specific test for detection of syphilis antigen include", "option1": "VDRL", "option2": "TPHA", "option3": "TPPA", "option4": "FTA-ABS", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3386.jpeg\" width=\"1414\" height=\"751\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "25", "question": "২৫) Complications of delayed therapy in gonorrhea is", "option1": "Acute urethritis", "option2": "Nebothian cysts", "option3": "Chronic prostatitis", "option4": "Epididymo-orchitis", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3385.jpeg\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "26", "question": "২৬) Curdy white vaginal discharge is found in", "option1": "Trichomoniasis", "option2": "Candidiasis", "option3": "Bacterial vaginosis", "option4": "Streptococcal infection", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3383.jpeg\" width=\"1005\" height=\"993\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "27", "question": "২৭) A 22-year-old student has fever, headache, and a non-productive cough. Laboratory investigations reveal anemia with evidence of hemolysis and a positive cold agglutinin test. Which organism is responsible?", "option1": "Streptococcus pneumoniae", "option2": "Mycoplasma pneumoniae", "option3": "Legionella pneumoniae", "option4": "Klebsiella", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3382.jpeg\" width=\"1623\" height=\"820\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "28", "question": "২৮) Which value is true regarding CURB 65 score?", "option1": "Urea &lt;7mmol/L", "option2": "Respiratory rate &gt;25 breaths/min", "option3": "Age &gt;75 ", "option4": "Confusion ", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3381.jpeg\" width=\"1726\" height=\"937\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "29", "question": "২৯) Most common complications of pneumonia-", "option1": "Parapneumonic effusion", "option2": "Empyma", "option3": "Lung abscess", "option4": "Lung collapse", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3375.jpeg\" width=\"1390\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "30", "question": "৩০) Definitive test for diagnosis of tuberculosis is-", "option1": "Sputum for AFB", "option2": "Sputum for gene xpert", "option3": "Sputum culture", "option4": "MT", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3415.jpeg\" width=\"1948\" height=\"684\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "31", "question": "৩১) Which is the most common extra-pulmonary site of tuberculosis?", "option1": "Liver", "option2": "Spleen ", "option3": "GIT", "option4": "Lymph node ", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3374.jpeg\" width=\"2031\" height=\"573\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "32", "question": "৩২) Which one is the drug of choice for the treatment of PKDL?", "option1": "Miltefosine", "option2": "Paramomycin", "option3": "Sodium stibogluconate", "option4": "Liposomal Amphotericin B", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3479.jpeg\" width=\"1926\" height=\"770\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "33", "question": "৩৩) A 45-year-old man presents with high fever, productive cough, and foul-smelling sputum. Chest X-ray shows a thick-walled cavity with an air–fluid level. What is the most likely diagnosis?", "option1": "Lung abscess ", "option2": "Bronchiectasis", "option3": "Ca lung ", "option4": "Aspergillosis ", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>Clue: <br>air- fluid level<br>foul smelling sputum</p>"}, {"id": "34", "question": "৩৪) Breathlessness with clear lung is found in all condition stated below except-", "option1": "Metabolic acidosis ", "option2": "Left ventricular failure ", "option3": "Psychogenic hyperventilation", "option4": "Pulmonary embolism ", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3372.jpeg\" width=\"1145\" height=\"617\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "35", "question": "৩৫) Barrel shaped chest is found in-", "option1": "Asthma", "option2": "COPD", "option3": "Ca lung ", "option4": "Lung abscess", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3371.jpeg\" width=\"1679\" height=\"959\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "36", "question": "৩৬) Rashes of measles appears on", "option1": "3rd day", "option2": "4th day", "option3": "6th day", "option4": "7th day", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3368.jpeg\" width=\"1377\" height=\"765\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "37", "question": "৩৭) A 55-year-old diabetic patient on insulin is found unconscious at home. His skin is cold and sweaty, and his blood glucose is 2.1 mmol/L. What is the most likely cause of unconsciousness?", "option1": "DKA", "option2": "HHS", "option3": "Hypoglycaemia ", "option4": "Electrolyte imbalance ", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3367.jpeg\" width=\"1886\" height=\"1071\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "38", "question": "৩৮) Pel Ebstein fever is a feature of -", "option1": "Thyrotoxicosis", "option2": "Hodgkin’s lymphoma", "option3": "Non-hodgkin’s lymphoma", "option4": "Enteric fever ", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3369.jpeg\" width=\"1648\" height=\"685\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "39", "question": "৩৯) Which is the investigation of choice for pulmonary embolism?", "option1": "CXR", "option2": "Spirometry", "option3": "CTPA", "option4": "CT chest", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/IMG_3370.jpeg\" width=\"1867\" height=\"596\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "40", "question": "৪০) A young man suddenly develops acute chest pain and dyspnoea at rest. Chest examination shows reduced chest movement, absent breath sounds, and hyperresonance on one side. What is the most likely diagnosis?", "option1": "Pulmonary embolism ", "option2": "Pneumothorax ", "option3": "Lung abscess", "option4": "LVF", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>Clues: sudden chest pain + dyspnea + absent breath sound+ hyper resonant percussion </p>"}]}, "_source": "archive-question-subject", "_exam_id": 15823, "custom_field": "প্রতি প্রশ্নের মান ১ ও ভুল উত্তরের জন্য ০.৫০ কাটা যাবে।", "exam_time": "1200000", "is_omr": true, "omr_time": "1440000", "examname": "Jul 20, 2026", "type": "BCS-Health-Medic", "payment": "BALANCE_NOT"}